'''Peerless Too''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] and appears every Friday. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Rope Jump Cat (Rare Cat)|Rope Jump Cat]]: Noodle Cats.

